          show pkWire k 0 ≠ 104 by dsimp only [pkWire, Wire] at *; omega, show pkWire k 0 ≠ fA by dsimp only [pkWire, Wire] at *; omega, show pkWire k 0 ≠ fB by dsimp only [pkWire, Wire] at *; omega,
